"mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-"
"outputs/56dfec5d-556b-486d-9cbf-0700582ec25c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Salida de la celda de código anterior](/learning/images/modules/quantum-"
"mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-"
